strings.USA_ICW_desc:
Tokyo's favorite lapdog has gone rabid. Mohammad Hatta and his followers have raised the flag of revolt, and the golden goose of Japan is now stewing in its own juice. And that smell is delicious to Australia, who sees a chance to stab into the underbelly of the Sphere, avenge their losses, and liberate the slaving masses of the archipelago.

It is our duty to support freedom wherever it dawns. Hatta must have what he needs to win the war. Australia must have what they need to help him do it. And if all else fails, we will save Indonesia from the sphere, regardless of what must be done.

Current phase: {get_icwphase}

strings.USA_wac_desc_1:
The foothold of the Free World in West Africa is under threat! Under the guise of 'anti-colonialism', the Pan-African Liberation Front - little more than Japanese stooges playing up racial politics - is marching upon our old allies in Free France, as well as any fellow Africans who have spurned their home-grown version of imperialism.

It is our duty - and in our best interests - to stand against totalitarians, fascist or not. The American people are having difficulty grasping our justification for intervention, but that stems from ignorance of reality. If we fail to oppose those self-proclaimed crusaders, their oriental masters will dig cruel, greedy blades into the heart, soil, and soul of free Africa.

We have escalated the war by {WAC_escalation}%.{getusawacgarrisonactive}

strings.USA_wac_desc_2:
The foothold of the Free World in West Africa is under threat! The French and their allies - old friends of ours - are beset on all sides by enemies of freedom. To the west and north: opportunists and the misguided, striking at the French for all manner of petty reasons. To the east: Japan's hypocritical puppets, the Pan-African Liberation Front. To the south: the great Atlantic, from which the OFN will arrive to defend its brothers-in-arms.

There is considerable domestic resistance to involving the USA in such a chaotic war, especially with the added complexity of a third side which is clearly not backed by our global enemies. Still, involve ourselves we must, for the sake of free nations everywhere. Whether or not they are stooges of fascists, the enemies of freedom are the enemies of America.

We have escalated the war by {WAC_escalation}%.{getusawacgarrisonactive}

